### AI Inference Gateway — Sample Requests
### Use with IntelliJ HTTP Client or VS Code REST Client extension

### ─── Health Check (no auth required) ───

GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

###

### ─── Inference ───

### Happy path: send a prompt to the default provider
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/inference
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

{
  "model": "qwen3",
  "prompt": "What is 2+2? Answer in one word."
}

###

### Explicit provider routing
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/inference
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

{
  "provider": "ollama-local",
  "model": "qwen3",
  "prompt": "Explain recursion in one sentence."
}

###

### Missing prompt → 400 INVALID_REQUEST
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/inference
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

{
  "model": "qwen3"
}

###

### Missing API key → 401 UNAUTHORIZED
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/inference
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "qwen3",
  "prompt": "Hello"
}

###

### ─── Providers ───

### List all active providers and their models
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/providers
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

###

### ─── Logs ───

### Default pagination (page 0, size 20)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/logs
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

###

### Custom page size
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/logs?page=0&size=5
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

###

### Filter by provider
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/logs?provider=ollama-local
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

###

### Filter by status
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/logs?status=SUCCESS
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

###

### Filter by date range (ISO-8601)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/logs?from=2026-08-01T00:00:00&to=2026-08-05T23:59:59
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

###

### Combined filters
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/logs?provider=ollama-local&status=SUCCESS&page=0&size=10
X-API-Key: test-api-key-1

###
